# README screenshots: the graph canvas over the three offline sample meres,
# then the same canvas beside the Overview pane. Offline; run on a fresh
# TURNSTONE_ROOT. The window is sized in logical pixels, so a 2x display
# captures 2400x1440; the README copies are scaled to 1600 wide.
resize 1200 720
settle 30
key escape
open mere://alpha
settle 10
open mere://beta
settle 10
open mere://gamma
settle 120
act Fit to view
settle 30
assert nodes >= 15
capture 01_canvas
act Open Gloss pane
settle 20
assert pane gloss
capture 02_overview
log README screenshots complete
